{"id": "ee51d067-f009-4728-9799-b0f9ab4a2774", "type": "concept", "title": "build-buy-borrow decisions"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches students to connect business demand, talent supply, and staffing choices."}, {"id": "e47c5ec0-0d81-4510-9937-cb5ea158c49e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Job analysis", "children": [{"id": "9b6183ce-971b-46ac-a861-ac4abc68a797", "type": "concept", "title": "task analysis"}, {"id": "d5940f9a-6ff4-49c7-8387-5b72c579b090", "type": "concept", "title": "KSAOs"}, {"id": "33f8ec0e-2c12-44a2-83e5-97dc2c693b31", "type": "concept", "title": "competency models"}, {"id": "abb9eb93-96a2-43de-8f91-44be052e39f3", "type": "concept", "title": "essential functions"}, {"id": "660d4b95-65c2-4f9d-8dc3-f8fca3bca64e", "type": "concept", "title": "job documentation"}], "description": "Students learn how to identify duties, responsibilities, knowledge, skills, abilities, and working conditions."}, {"id": "d237de3a-c70b-426e-b98e-74fb4a44fc11", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Job descriptions and job design", "children": [{"id": "97822030-4f08-4c74-b14f-469b0221910e", "type": "concept", "title": "job summaries"}, {"id": "6fecf75b-53f9-4493-b809-54ebb6fb0cc9", "type": "concept", "title": "responsibilities"}, {"id": "16b1d665-897e-4387-823b-1ed6e1ee4236", "type": "concept", "title": "minimum qualifications"}, {"id": "06c819cc-e5fb-40bc-9f03-0b443b879f66", "type": "concept", "title": "job enrichment"}, {"id": "daefcd44-9844-46bc-929c-4fc559ff6ccb", "type": "concept", "title": "work design"}], "description": "This subtopic links job analysis to clear job descriptions, legal defensibility, performance expectations, and meaningful work design."}]}, {"id": "b03d6233-8539-449f-bd2b-7b68c9cc6c4c", "type": "topic", "title": "Recruitment, Employer Brand, and Talent Pipelines", "description": "Students explore how organizations attract candidates and build diverse, qualified talent pipelines before selection begins.", "children": [{"id": "9292b2f3-61f1-464f-80e2-